{"id":"633687","name":"蔬菜炒饭","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633687/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冷饭","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小白菜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"娃娃菜","amount":"50g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"酸豇豆","amount":"30g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小白菜已经切成小段。","img":"images/633687/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"娃娃菜洗净切成小块。","img":"images/633687/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"油入锅热以后，打入鸡蛋。","img":"images/633687/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撒入盐，煎到两面金黄即可。","img":"images/633687/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用煎鸡蛋的余油煎炒两种蔬菜。","img":"images/633687/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒到蔬菜变软加入盐。","img":"images/633687/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入酸豇豆节炒香。","img":"images/633687/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入冷饭一起翻炒。","img":"images/633687/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入盐调味。","img":"images/633687/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/633687/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}